{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7811eb60975c103219eab11ee6c78d79d6fecd4a224357492474977af977328b", "ja": "（明日はいよいよ、美奈子の初公演だ。\n俺も明日に備えて、そろそろ帰るか……）", "zh": "（明天就是美奈子的首次公演了。\n我也该为明天做好准备，早点回家……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "bc57526c2a50fde814682098307bb75291e7a85648faba6662dc0047d1ee3562", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nこんな遅くまでお仕事ですか？　お疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你工作到这么晚吗？辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8e2c8bd17f9666bac7a17e80592b5b8513783859c375d81c1b29f9f6c483d924", "ja": "美奈子？\nこんな時間まで残ってたのか？", "zh": "美奈子？\n你留到现在啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "6c20b8ec547cf1ff4da024f4de1bff78c86516d27a6aaa6766ec5d7d1391da18", "ja": "はい！　実はダンスの振り付けに、ちょっとだけ\n自信のないところがあって、残って練習してたんです。", "zh": "是的！其实是因为我对舞蹈动作没什么信心，\n所以才留下来练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "a74e9f290747db8f0ec27e5170385f9e5c2894470db796014dfaa667164fd37b", "ja": "奈緒ちゃんに付き合ってもらって、バッチリ\n覚えましたよ！　明日は、安心して見ててくださいね！", "zh": "我请小绪陪我练习，现在已经完全记起来了！\n明天请你放心地看着吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "af1fd47055b35b931ff36112f343f62001dfbb3ef8e703687c41d97269525a76", "ja": "なるほど、そうだったのか……お疲れさま。\n明日が本番だけど、緊張はしてないみたいだな。", "zh": "原来如此，是这样啊……辛苦你了。\n明天就要正式上台了，你看起来似乎不太紧张呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "f9d33d77c28ec960e87d6433bb7a9c2d1eded6dc0978a1d160a56bb8eb3bd22e", "ja": "そう見えますか？\nでも、これでけっこう、緊張してるんですよ～。", "zh": "看起来是这样吗？\n但我其实挺紧张的耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "790290cea8757f2c3ed6ecc726fab3ae4dcc36661e21272b99a17188c27c72d4", "ja": "そうなのか？\nその割に、落ち着いて見えるけど……。", "zh": "是吗？\n但你感觉挺冷静的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "5feb0ac495ec5545164a0e45ae7b6687194d4da431fccb82342ecc5f21bfc8e0", "ja": "えへへ～。そこはやっぱり、\n家族や友達が応援してくれてますからね！", "zh": "嘿嘿～那是因为\n有家人跟朋友的支持啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "e3f2f992a7b93e8cf2c933dc6fddb78d2560813ee6f4050859c478304b433512", "ja": "お客さん達にも、家族や友達にも……\nみんなに、楽しんでいってほしいな～って！", "zh": "无论是观众、家人或朋友……\n我希望能让大家都乐在其中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "de0d302c63f6ee71263ab52945dfdb73ee53f448a30d10574dd3a357d8ef0ef3", "ja": "そうか。\n周りの人達の笑顔が、美奈子のパワーの源なんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。\n周围人们的笑容，就是美奈子力量的来源呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "601350cd25fd610752bc634d77ef7333af11263789e2e9756935974f93464528", "ja": "はい！\nあとはやっぱり、おいしいご飯ですね！", "zh": "没错！\n还有好吃的饭应该也是来源之一！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e4f5ec85627f01bf26a122e33ae30b65b7bc11467221518f67e874fa33f8cd76", "ja": "ご飯？", "zh": "饭？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "63b4d405f6d09c01f4b2dcb905c312ef0685e2a716a63d6ed6d35ad45b3a127c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、笑いましたね～？\n大事ですよ、ご飯は！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，你笑了对吧～？\n吃饭很重要喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "85099f8131584297324d67580af0b6c85102b0e1039895442dc0190c3047a3c3", "ja": "毎日ちゃんとおいしいご飯を食べてるからこそ、\nお仕事ができて、ぐっすり眠れるんです！", "zh": "正因为每天都吃好吃的饭，\n才能充满活力地工作、晚上睡个好觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "40e12f2d274a6dca6a74a03a4337b1f365e3ef0c7e07bd406987f3a4a83c5d3f", "ja": "私、アイドルになってから、ますます健康は大事だって\n思うようになりました。そのためにも、ご飯です！", "zh": "自从当上偶像后，我渐渐感受到健康的重要性。\n为了健康，就得吃饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1016_p", "source_sha256": "061f47324446fd5da5c1705c1da633ef88428370b45bc498869939717fde1226", "ja": "確かにアイドルの仕事は、健康管理が大事だな。", "zh": "对偶像的工作来说，健康管理确实很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "0597bdd30d001e0ed0c900bd297a94fe565229095a6aa3c0d4999b301a6ea9ae", "ja": "そうですよね！\n……でも、アイドルに限ったことじゃないですよ？", "zh": "就是说吧！\n……不过，这可不限于偶像喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "2ec3685157b648589633f8c15ca35846e3e440aff69ac907b356e01b387a818f", "ja": "{$P$}さん、疲れた顔してます。\nご飯、ちゃんと食べてますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你看起来很累。\n你有好好吃饭吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "3438378d622f07bb993cc60ced17387d95fa64ddfa4507d198057ff5d193e3f5", "ja": "お仕事が大変なのはわかりますけど、\n忙しくてもご飯は抜いちゃダメですよ！", "zh": "虽然我知道你工作很忙，\n但就算忙也不能不吃饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ec9d38504cf5ef84fc24c4f1a4d9a83c7cef8e03eef4ddc1b0a6d6f4378cf8ae", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\n気をつけるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，你说得对。\n我会注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "d1237a254f2253b110d115dbe26ea6305a030a86a5f98c93cdb89dc16d500d17", "ja": "どうしても忙しい時は、言ってくださいね！\n私、お弁当とか作ってきますから！", "zh": "真的忙不过来的时候，要跟我说喔！\n我会替你准备便当的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1023_p", "source_sha256": "95e0af3c7ca4af4b63bcd98f7ea58c010135eb3c7a84a5612c9e77255769e972", "ja": "ありがとう。……って、これじゃ、\nどっちがプロデューサーか分からないな。", "zh": "谢谢……但这样一来，\n都不知道谁才是制作人了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "ca1b42b0de8728f6f4429ba9768dc30a41083853ba324bd3d04205bcf236fa7c", "ja": "そんな、私なんてまだまだですよ！\n劇場のみんなに、助けてもらってばっかりで……。", "zh": "怎么会，我还差得远呢！\n我总是受到剧场伙伴们的帮助……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "cd4e0be7378c4e9ffb350ec415ad01221dc6ab708f88c9cb84d8138fbf5ed302", "ja": "それに……えっと、\n{$P$}さんにも……えへへ♪", "zh": "而且……那个，\n{$P$}也帮了我很多……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1026_p", "source_sha256": "65392c9c11edf34aada589111784af852776552b10733bd0328a1a42a3d36f2d", "ja": "そうか。\n頼りになってるなら、よかったよ。", "zh": "是吗。\n要是有成为你的后盾，那就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "8172e053fb055338ea3c68c5c5da844e7aa34702c2cd7ec9cfc7b577966455e2", "ja": "はいっ、もちろんです！\nもう、全力で頼っちゃってますからね～。", "zh": "有啊，当然有！\n我可是非常依赖你这个后盾呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "00509bae17784acbc5b5c406ffd729e1607ef8387ba470674ac16ae129ef1efd", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n明日のステージ、楽しみにしててくださいね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n请你好好期待明天的表演喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "8e50b9843f51f25da2b03f851e362616c3ae4455d321323333f2546511a2c1f8", "ja": "アイドルになった私の成長、見てくださいっ！\n……なんて、まだまだヒヨッコですけどね♪", "zh": "请你见证我当上偶像后的成长！\n……话虽如此，我也还只是菜鸟啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1030_p", "source_sha256": "bb5b54e4af8d19c7db37fca49088e9513f4b4304c18f843b8b927349f029fdee", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ！\nお互い、ちゃんとご飯を食べて、頑張ろうな！", "zh": "嗯，那当然！\n我们彼此都要好好吃饭，努力加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "ca939ab70d11ce9f42cdad68a37966a8c39bce476d08726b4fc30639aa18c93a", "ja": "はいっ♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_003_1032_p", "source_sha256": "cc142326462bc26c06b60dae08cfae95f83ef68d30e3b496164f482262de05bc", "ja": "（みんなのために美奈子が作り上げるステージ……\nきっと優しくて、あたたかいものになるだろう！）", "zh": "（美奈子为大家带来的舞台……\n肯定是场既温馨又温暖的表演吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
